      "content": "finding joy in \"hobbies\" feels so stupid though. like, what's the point of painting or whatever when the system just grinds you down anyway? it feels like trying to put a band-aid on a broken engine. the machine just keeps turning, and i'm just being used up. i don't feel like there's a \"me\" left to find.",
